        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ita 12:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.23.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 23:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana yishura Balamu, iti Ntuz’ ujane na bo, kandi ntuz’ uvume abo bantu, kukw ar’ abāhezagiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Balamu aravyuka, abarira abo bamenyekana ba Balaki, ati Ni mwīgīre, mwisubirire i wanyu, kuk’ Uhoraho yanse kunyemerera ko tujana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bamenyekana b’i Mowabu barahaguruka, basubira kwa Balaki, bati Balamu yanse ko tuzanana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki yongera gutuma abandi bamenyekana, barusha abo ubginshi, babarusha n’icubahiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baja kwa Balamu, baramubgira, bati Balaki mwene Sipori ngo Ntihagire ikintu kikubuza kuza kumwitaba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngo Kukw azoguha icubahiro cinshi, kandi ngw Ico uzogomba cose ni co azogukorera: none ngo N’uze, arakwinginze, umuvumire abo bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.22.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 22:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balamu yishura abo bantu ba Balaki, ati Balaki naho yompa ifeza n’izahabu vyuzuye inzu yiwe, sinoshobora gukora ikinyurana n’ijambo ry’Uhoraho Imana yanje, ari gito cank’ ari kinini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko namwe, enda ni murāre hano iri joro, ndābe ico Uhoraho yongera kumbarira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana iza kuri Balamu iryo joro, iramubarira, it’ Abo bantu asangwa baje kuguhamagara, pfa kuva hasi, ujane na bo; mugabo, ico nzokubarira cose, az’ abe ari co ukora gusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
