        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Balamu aravyuka, ashira amatandiko ku ndogoba yiwe, ajana na ba bamenyekana b’i Mowabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.4.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 4:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uburake bg’Imana buraziriringa kukw agiye: umumarayika w’Uhoraho ahagarara mu nzira ngw amutāngīre. Kandi yari ku ndogoba yiwe, abashumba biwe babiri bari kumwe na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ iyo ndogoba ibona uwo mumarayika w’Uhoraho ahagaze mu nzira, yāsokōye inkota, ica irakevya, iva mu nzira, ica mu vyatsi. Balamu arayikubita ngw ayisubize mu nzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ uwo mumarayika w’Uhoraho aragenda ahagarara mu murombero uca hagati y’imirima y’imizabibu, urombeye impande zompi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo ndogoba ibonye uwo mumarayika w’Uhoraho, yiyagiriza ku murombero, iwuhomberanirizakw ikirenge ca Balamu: arongera arayikubita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ uwo mumarayika w’Uhoraho yīgirayo, ahagarara mu mbombane, hatagira akanya ko gukebereza i buryo cank’ i bumoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo ndogoba ibonye uwo mumarayika w’Uhoraho, ica iryama Balamu akiri kuri yo: uburake bga Balamu buraziriringa, ayikubita inkoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 2:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho abumbura akanwa k’iyo ndogoba, ibaza Balamu, it’ Umpoye iki, kunkubita ibihetangabo gatatu kose? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balamu arayishura, ati N’uk’ urik’ uramfyinako. Iyo mba mfise inkota mu ntoke, mba nkwishe aka kanya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo ndogoba ibaza Balamu, iti Sind’ indogoba yawe, wama ugenderako gushitsa uyu musi? Har’ aho nigeze kukugirira nk’ibi? Arahakana, at’ Oya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
